Practical No. 12
DTO Pattern – Separating the Entity from the API Contract
Textbook Reference: Chapter 6 — Building RESTful Microservices
Objective
Decouple the persistent JPA entity from the data actually exposed by the REST API using the Data Transfer
Object (DTO) pattern — hiding sensitive/internal fields (here, password) and mapping between Entity and
DTO. Built with Spring Boot, Spring Data JPA, Maven, and an embedded H2 database.
